<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT CARDIFF 53-29.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT CARDIFF 53-29.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat Cardiff 53-29 (halftime 22-3) in a tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Afato So'oalo (3), Pailate Fili, Pat Lam, Junior Paramore, Veli Patu. Conversions: Earl Va'a (6). Penalties: Va'a (2).</p>
<p>Cardiff - Tries: Lee Jarvis, I.Jones, Lee Jones, Delme Williams. Conversions: Jarvis (3). Penalty: Jarvis.</p>
</text>
